  58:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/icmp.c **** /** Small optimization: set to 0 if incoming PBUF_POOL pbuf always can be
  59:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/icmp.c ****  * used to modify and send a response packet (and to 1 if this is not the case,
  60:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/icmp.c ****  * e.g. when link header is stripped off when receiving) */
